    },
    {
      "tag": "SECTION",
      "text": "Waabi voices.\n\nI get to work on tough, meaningful problems with world-class peers who share a scientific mindset, constantly advancing our simulator to validate safe self-driving at the highest fidelity.\n\nSahil Jain\nSoftware Developer II, Sensor Simulation\n1\n/ 9",
      "cls": "relative w-full overflow-clip bg-white py-[calc(var(--padding-y)*0.5)]",
      "rect": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3210,
        "width": 1440,
